 anyone makes any of the following acts without consent of the person, the person has the right to demand that the act be stopped and that the infringer assume civil liability in accordance with the law:
(一) entering into a private place of the person;
(二) peeping into the private place of the person;
(三) hiding to spy on the person;
(四) peeping into the private activities of the person;
(五) secretly recording the conversation of the person by any other means.
